message: "If you use this project in teaching or research, please cite it as below."
title: "Math Stage: Interactive Primary Math Learning Platform"
abstract: >-
  An interactive, parameter-driven math learning site for primary grades 1-6,
  turning textbook worked examples into manipulable visualization Labs and
  training mini-games. Built with Nuxt 4, Vue 3 and Nuxt UI, deployed as a
  single static site on Cloudflare Pages.
type: software
